{"4223220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DISPEL", "steam_appid": 4223220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In DISPEL, play as the sole survivor of an unknown magical calamity. Explore the ruins of a corrupted wizard academy, avoid the shades of your former friends, solve puzzles to discover new areas of the school, and uncover what happened in Feylight Academy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/322d11b42061d1146d70dba6d075e551.avif?t=1771450780\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/e99a21cc32d752b4fc94554aeb85d82e.poster.avif?t=1777057791\" width=512 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/e99a21cc32d752b4fc94554aeb85d82e.webm?t=1777057791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/e99a21cc32d752b4fc94554aeb85d82e.mp4?t=1777057791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ruins of a corrupted wizard academy while the shades of your former friends hunt you through its halls. You’ll need cunning and guile to escape with your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/5105c5ce9de84538b1aec4ca331cc486.avif?t=1771450780\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/22bf1491a5ebef4961a6a6772b92c7af.poster.avif?t=1777057791\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/22bf1491a5ebef4961a6a6772b92c7af.webm?t=1777057791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/22bf1491a5ebef4961a6a6772b92c7af.mp4?t=1777057791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remnants of magic have been left behind by victims of the calamity. Solve puzzles to unlock these hidden spells, then activate and use them to defeat your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/63fe79685587effb76791288b3dcffad.avif?t=1771450780\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/881913f89791c64cc40cc0780a1e5837.poster.avif?t=1777057791\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/881913f89791c64cc40cc0780a1e5837.webm?t=1777057791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/881913f89791c64cc40cc0780a1e5837.mp4?t=1777057791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for scraps of knowledge scattered through the halls of Feylight Academy. Learn who its residents were, and discover the cause of the calamity that destroyed them all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made by students at the University of Utah as part of our senior Capstone project. Thank you for playing!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In DISPEL, play as the sole survivor of an unknown magical calamity. Explore the ruins of a corrupted wizard academy, avoid the shades of your former friends, solve puzzles to discover new areas of the school, and uncover what happened in Feylight Academy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/322d11b42061d1146d70dba6d075e551.avif?t=1771450780\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/e99a21cc32d752b4fc94554aeb85d82e.poster.avif?t=1777057791\" width=512 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/e99a21cc32d752b4fc94554aeb85d82e.webm?t=1777057791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/e99a21cc32d752b4fc94554aeb85d82e.mp4?t=1777057791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ruins of a corrupted wizard academy while the shades of your former friends hunt you through its halls. You’ll need cunning and guile to escape with your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/5105c5ce9de84538b1aec4ca331cc486.avif?t=1771450780\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/22bf1491a5ebef4961a6a6772b92c7af.poster.avif?t=1777057791\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223220/extras/22bf1491a5eb